{"seq":79,"slug":"chaos-engineering","title":"混沌工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.8,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"混沌工程\">混沌工程</h1><p>分布式系统的可用性只会衰减，不会叠加。一个由几百个微服务织成的系统，无论每个组件单独多么可靠，端到端的失效都不是「会不会」的问题，而是「何时、以何种形态」的问题。传统测试沿着已知的正确路径验证「代码按规格工作」，却无法回答那个真正致命的问题：当系统不按规格工作时，会发生什么？混沌工程就是为填补这个空白而生——它主动、有纪律地向系统注入故障，把本会在凌晨三点以生产事故形式暴露的脆弱点，提前在工作时间、受控范围内揭示出来。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 用四章把混沌工程从思想讲到落地，层层递进。</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」打地基：讲清五条核心原则、为何值得这么折腾，并把「可证伪的假设」与「可控的爆炸半径」从比喻变成可计算的工程参数。这是理解后续一切的前提。</p>\n<p>第二章「实验」讲方法：故障远不止「杀实例」，要理解资源、网络、依赖、状态各层的故障谱系；要用面向业务的稳态指标而非 CPU 来判定成败；并把这些零件装配成一条「假设-设计-执行-观测-复盘」的可重复流水线。</p>\n<p>第三章「实践」讲落地：从门槛最低的 GameDay 集体演练起步锻炼团队，到把实验自动化成像单元测试一样的常态基础设施，再到 Chaos Mesh、Gremlin、Litmus 等主流工具的按场景选型。</p>\n<p>第四章「成熟度」讲进阶与收口：如何在最危险也最有价值的生产环境安全建立真实信心，如何用无指责文化让混沌工程长期存活，以及如何把一切汇入「持续验证」——让「确认系统在真实世界仍按预期运行」变得像跑测试一样廉价而自动。</p>\n<p>四章之间不是孤立的——稳态、假设、爆炸半径、自动化、护栏这些概念会反复出现、彼此呼应，文中以交叉链接串成一张知识网。读完会明白：混沌工程不是制造混沌，而是用受控的混沌，换取对秩序的真实信心。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chaos-principles","title":"混沌工程的原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/foundations/chaos-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"why-chaos","title":"为何需要混沌工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/foundations/why-chaos"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hypothesis-blast-radius","title":"假设与爆炸半径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/foundations/hypothesis-blast-radius"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"experiments","title":"实验","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/experiments","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"failure-injection","title":"故障注入类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/experiments/failure-injection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"steady-state-metrics","title":"稳态与度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/experiments/steady-state-metrics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"experiment-design","title":"实验设计与执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/experiments/experiment-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"practices","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/practices","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"game-days","title":"混沌演练 GameDay","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/practices/game-days"},{"seq":2,"slug":"automated-chaos","title":"自动化混沌","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/practices/automated-chaos"},{"seq":3,"slug":"chaos-tooling","title":"工具：Chaos Mesh、Gremlin 与 Litmus","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/practices/chaos-tooling"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"maturity","title":"成熟度","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/maturity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"production-chaos","title":"生产环境混沌","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/maturity/production-chaos"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reliability-culture","title":"可靠性文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/maturity/reliability-culture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"continuous-verification","title":"持续验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/chaos-engineering/maturity/continuous-verification"}]}]}